@startuml
title First-Time Login with Certificate File

|Taxpayer|
start
:Enter personal data;

if (Registration type?) then (Private individual)
  :Enter identification number,\ndate of birth, e-mail address,\nand user name;
else (Organization)
  :Enter federal state, organization tax number,\ncontact-person details,\nand user name;
endif

|ELSTER Portal|
:Submit registration data;

|Async Delivery Channels\n(email + postal service)|
:Send six-digit verification code by e-mail;

|Taxpayer|
:Enter verification code on Mein ELSTER;

|ELSTER Portal|
:Confirm e-mail address;

|Taxpayer|
if (Identity verification method?) then (By mail)

  |Async Delivery Channels\n(email + postal service)|
  split
    :Send Activation ID by e-mail;
  split again
    :Deliver Activation Code by post;
  end split

  |Taxpayer|
  :Open activation link after receiving\nboth activation data;
  :Enter Activation ID and Activation Code;

  |ELSTER Portal|
  :Activate access;

else (Online verification)

  |Taxpayer|
  if (Online method?) then (Nect Wallet)
    :Use smartphone, Nect Wallet app,\nand identity card;

    |Online-ID Provider\n(AusweisApp / Nect Wallet-App)|
    :Record identity card and selfie video;\nverify video and voice recording;

  else (Online ID function)
    |Taxpayer|
    :Use identity card and PIN with\nAusweisApp and NFC device or card reader;

    |Online-ID Provider\n(AusweisApp / Nect Wallet-App)|
    :Perform online ID verification;
  endif

  |ELSTER Portal|
  :Create user account;
endif

:Display secure login options;

|Taxpayer|
:Select certificate file\nunder "Other Login options";
:Define certificate file name\nand password;

|ELSTER Portal|
:Create certificate file;

|Taxpayer|
:Download and save the certificate\nwith the .pfx extension;
:Select the downloaded certificate file\nand enter its password;

|ELSTER Portal|
:Perform initial login;

|Taxpayer|
stop

legend
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | Filled circle | Initial node: process begins |
  | Rounded rectangle | Action performed by the named participant |
  | Diamond | Decision or merge based on an alternative path |
  | Thick bar | Fork and join of separate delivery activities |
  | Arrow | Control flow between actions |
  | Bull's-eye | Activity final node: process ends |
  | Swimlane | Participant responsible for the enclosed actions |
endlegend

@enduml